               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_3f84a2e9">2 bifolios and 1 smaller folio (30.5 x 24.5 cm) bound together in brown leather half binding with marbled sides. On front cover a handwritten label inscribed: "J.P.E. Hartmann / Børnestykker / (Novellette ... Op. 55)". Written in brown ink and pencil. Paper: 16 staves (bifolios) and 18 staves (folio). Paginated in pencil skipping the third page, containing sketches in pencil only. Title above the first stave on p. 1: "Børnestykker." Added in pencil in Hartmann's hand: "Lykønskning til en Fødselsdag." Written in the following order: I Allegretto (end-dated: "15/12 52."); II Allegro moderato (end-dated: "23/12 52."); IV Allegro molto vivace, "Tagfat" added in pencil (end-dated: "24/5 53"); III Mazurka (end-dated: "27/8 53."); V Andantino, "Morgenbøn" added in pencil (end-dated "30/5 55"); VI "Eventyr" added in pencil (end-dated "6/6 55.").</physMedium>
